  "goodToKnow": "Die Vermarktung is marketing or commercialisation: die Vermarktung eines Films, die Vermarktung von Daten. Die Direktvermarktung is direct selling, for example farm shops (Hofläden) selling eggs and vegetables straight to customers. The verb vermarkten means to market: sich gut vermarkten (to sell oneself well). Das Marketing is a near synonym, more for the strategy. Plural: die Vermarktungen."
